  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_8437.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">Ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as&nbsp;han sido&nbsp;protagonistas este martes en las fiestas del Barri de Sant Pere, en Onda,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">&nbsp;con hinchables, comida y el desfile nocturno de disfraces, acompa&ntilde;ado por la Xaranga Llenya al Bombo.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestessantpere14/img_8420.jpg\" alt=\"img_8420\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestessantpere14/img_8422.jpg\" alt=\"img_8422\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestessantpere14/img_8423.jpg\" alt=\"img_8423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestessantpere14/img_8425.jpg\" alt=\"img_8425\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestessantpere14/img_8426.jpg\" alt=\"img_8426\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestessantpere14/img_8427.jpg\" alt=\"img_8427\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestessantpere14/img_8428.jpg\" alt=\"img_8428\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressesfestessantpere14/img_8429.jpg\" alt=\"img_8429\" style=\"max-width: